poemTitle: "2016 October"
author: "Eila Webster"
bgTheme: "antiquewhite"
endOfYear: false
---
<div class="full-width">
<poem-grid :title="poemTitle" :author="author" :theme="bgTheme">

  <!-- Header Section -->
  <img src="/poems/2016-october/image-0.png" alt="" slot="header-tl" />
  <img src="/poems/2016-october/image-1.png" alt="" slot="header-tr" />

  <!-- Column 1 Images (15%) -->
  <div slot="col-1-images">
    <img src="/poems/2016-october/image-6.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/2016-october/image-8.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/2016-october/image-10.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/2016-october/image-12.png" alt="" />
  </div>

  <!-- Column 2 Text -->
  <div slot="col-2-text">
    <p>
      I can’t believe this is October,
      We’re in mid-Autumn once again;
      Oh! How quickly time has flown,
      Since I took up my pen.
    </p>

    <p>
      To herald in a bright New Year,
      With possibilities that caught attention;
      Better get your skates on quick,
      Before you are on the pension.
    </p>

    <p>
      Don’t leave it for retiral years,
      That’s classed as a bed of roses;
      Nobody mentions the many thorns,
      And failing energy in small doses.
    </p>

    <p>
      Do the things you wish for Now,
      Not on some far off future date;
      Go on! Start to tick them off,
      ‘til you clean up the slate.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Column 3 Middle Images -->
  <div slot="col-3-images">
    <img src="/poems/2016-october/image-2.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/2016-october/image-3.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/2016-october/image-4.png" alt="" />
  </div>

  <!-- Column 4 Text -->
  <div slot="col-4-text">
    <p>
      You’ll get a glow of satisfaction,
      And life will be a lot more fun;
      You’ll be storing up sweet memories,
      Wage earning jobs will still get done.
    </p>

    <p>
      Although this is a busy time,
      If you have a large garden plot;
      Earthing up carrots, neeps and leeks,
      Storing tatties for the soup pot!
    </p>

    <p>
      In the changing tapestry of life,
      Each month has a role to play;
      Keep looking for all the benefits,
      You could find along the way.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Column 5 Images (15%) -->
  <div slot="col-5-images">
    <img src="/poems/2016-october/image-5.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/2016-october/image-7.png" alt="" />
